tion, and comparative advantages of the giants vs. start-ups. The full tran=
slation is a 8,500-word, 20-pg. Google Doc.</span></p><p style=3D"margin:0 =
0 20px 0;color:rgb(54,55,55);line-height:26px;font-size:16px"><strong>Key P=
assages: When it comes to China=E2=80=99s AI super-app, everybody is chasin=
g ByteDance=E2=80=99s Doubao. Moonshot AI=E2=80=99s Kimi made waves with it=
s long-prompt processing capabilities in 2024; in early 2025, of course, De=
epSeek=E2=80=99s downloads briefly topped the charts; and Alibaba=E2=80=99s=
 Qwen relaunched successfully at the end of the year. Yet, as Honghao Gao r=
eports, =E2=80=9C Doubao consistently remained in first place.=E2=80=9D</st=
rong><span> </span></p><ul style=3D"margin-top:0;padding:0"><li style=3D"ma=
rgin:8px 0 0 32px"><p style=3D"color:rgb(54,55,55);line-height:26px;margin-=
bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:4px;font-size:16px;margin:0">La=
st year, ByteDance=E2=80=99s Doubao became the first AI product in China to=
 surpass 100 million daily active users. Doubao=E2=80=99s large model attai=
ned an average daily token processing volume of 63 trillion, a 200% increas=
e over the past six months.</p></li><li style=3D"margin:8px 0 0 32px"><p st=
yle=3D"color:rgb(54,55,55);line-height:26px;margin-bottom:0;box-sizing:bord=
er-box;padding-left:4px;font-size:16px;margin:0">In many ways, ByteDance wa=
s a sleeping giant. By the time ChatGPT launched in November 2022, Baidu, H=
uawei, and Alibaba had already released their own LLMs, but ByteDance had n=
ot. The next year, ByteDance=E2=80=99s AI efforts stalled. Their AI creatio=
n platform Jimeng did not =E2=80=9Cbecome the Douyin of the AI era=E2=80=9D=
, as they hoped.</p></li><li style=3D"margin:8px 0 0 32px"><p style=3D"colo=
r:rgb(54,55,55);line-height:26px;margin-bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;padd=
ing-left:4px;font-size:16px;margin:0">In fact, the breakthrough was an AI a=
ssistant named Doubao, which benefited from ByteDance=E2=80=99s Douyin (sho=
rtform video platform) and its unique voice call function. Regarding the fo=
rmer, videos of users =E2=80=9Ccreatively training=E2=80=9D Doubao=E2=80=99=
s voice went viral on Douyin, which boasts 800 million daily active users. =
As for the voice call function, the Doubao team:</p></li></ul><blockquote s=
tyle=3D"border-left:4px solid #4dd0e1;margin:20px 0;padding:0"><p style=3D"=
