to Novel, and Toutiao, but the user profiles are very homogeneous, leaning =
towards entertainment, with limited scope for cross-business traffic redire=
ction. Tencent, on the other hand, has leading products in almost every sec=
tor: WeChat, QQ, Tencent Video, Tencent Meeting, QQ Browser, QQ Music=E2=80=
=94they can find any type of user they want. This is their conviction.</em>=
